This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the U.S. Federal Plain Language Guidelines as a grounded IDD graph so
consuming projects can compose it with throughline-compose.

The Federal Plain Language Guidelines (PLAIN, March 2011 rev.1) are a work of the
U.S. federal government and are in the public domain. The guidance reproduced here in
items' text and attrs.source_ref is derived from that source; this repository claims
no ownership over that underlying content. See https://www.plainlanguage.gov for the
authoritative source.
